                    <img src="/img/pages/chat/gemini/gemini-06-import-web-crawl-transforms-applied.webp" alt="Crawl transforms applied to extracted Markdown pages" class="ss-zoom cursor-zoom-in h-auto w-full" loading="lazy">
                </div>
                <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Strip navigation and boilerplate with transforms you can preview.</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">See the diff before you pay for it</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                        Re-running a saved import doesn't blindly re-upload. Every document is classified first, so
